    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FitzGerald’s are delighted to present this derelict cottage for sale by Private Treaty. This property is located at Coolquill on a site of 0.17 ha (0.42 acres) and benefits from 30m road frontage. The property was built in the mid-19th century. \r\nThe cottage is located within a 5-minute drive of Killenaule with local shops including Centra, O’Dwyer’s butchers, Emo Oil Ladrigan's Killenaule Express, An Post, Killenaule Pharmacy etc. Coolquill is also within a 20minute drive to Callan and a 30minute drive to Cashel with links to the M8 motorway.\r\nWhile the property is in need of a total refurbishment it offers enormous potential to create a charming first home, development or investment opportunity. This is a very quaint property with lots of character and charm.  \r\n\r\nThe property has been vacant for over 50 years and may qualify for the Vacant Properties Refurbishment Grant.  https://kilkennycoco.ie/eng/services/planning/town-regeneration/vacant-homes-refurbishment-grant-scheme-croi-conaithe-towns-fund.html\r\n\r\nThis property is a unique opportunity for buyers to purchase a delightful property full of potential. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      }
